{
 "_doc": "EVENT FINDER — everything the Events tab's finder needs, declared once (Configs pattern: the page and EventFetcher.kt read this, no list lives in code). Sections: ramp (the fleet type ramp, mirrors KitStoreRow SCALE/TEXT_SCALE; the page turns it into CSS variables, no font-size literal in events-finder.css), defaults (first-run prefs), categories (the filter chips + how each maps onto a ticketer's own taxonomy + keywords used to classify an event), when (the time filter), views, cities (the picker's list; lat/lng drive API queries, ra_area is Resident Advisor's area id), ticketers (ONE ROW PER SOURCE: how it is fetched, which hosts it may touch, its terms, cache and politeness limits). Adding a ticketer/category/city is an entry HERE plus a rebuild; the parser id must exist in assets/events-core.js PARSERS. Baked into BuildConfig.EVENT_FINDER_B64 by app/build.gradle, same pattern as data/events.json.",
